**Important Security Note:** It is highly recommended *not* to send your Social Security Number (even just the last four digits) via standard, unencrypted email. If you are submitting this through a secure official portal, it is safe to include, but if you are sending a standard email, it's best to offer to provide it over the phone or via a secure form.

